{"metadata":{"description":"Pinned and statically verified Agent Skills for DeepSeek and DSH","id":"gh:1334184327","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"awesome-deepseek-skills","slug":"Whning0513/awesome-deepseek-skills","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agents","awesome-list","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Pinned and statically verified Agent Skills for DeepSeek and DSH"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Awesome DeepSeek Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A small, pinned catalog of Agent Skills that can be loaded by DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Every entry ha"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s an immutable source commit, a license pointer, a static report, and basic network/command/write hi"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" immutable source commit, a license pointer, a static report, and basic network/command/write hints."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This is deliberately not a scrape of every repository containing `SKILL.md`. The first catalog is sm"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"all enough to reproduce in CI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Browse"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"See the generated catalog, or list the machine-readable entries:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The initial set includes DeepSeek protocol diagnostics and a few established design and development "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"skills from Anthropic, Superpowers, and Trail of Bits."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Use it inside DSH"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Replace `demo` with your profile:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"After restarting DSH, two tools are available:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `deepseek_skills_list` searches the bundled catalog without going online.
- `deepseek_skill_instal"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"l` fetches one pinned source and installs it in the current project."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For example, ask DSH to list the development entries, then install the id you choose. The install to"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ol only writes to `.agents/skills` or `.dsh/skills`; it refuses an existing destination and does not"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" run anything from the skill. Git is required. Python is not required for the DSH plugin."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install one pinned skill"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The installer checks out the exact commit in the entry, refuses to overwrite an existing directory, "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"rejects symlinked files, and runs the DSH profile before copying anything. It does not execute skill"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ymlinked files, and runs the DSH profile before copying anything. It does not execute skill scripts."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"DSH discovers direct children of `.agents/skills` and `.dsh/skills`. The installer records provenanc"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e in `.deepseek-skills.lock.json` next to the installed bundles."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The Python installer and DSH plugin use the same catalog, pinning rules, and lock-file format. They "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"are tested on Linux, Windows, and macOS."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## What “verified” means here"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Each pinned source is checked with:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- the Agent Skills reference parser used by `deepseek-skill-doctor`;
- `skill-validator v1.6.0`, str"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ucture mode only;
- the DeepSeek/DSH compatibility profile."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Structure mode is intentional: external link checks depend on live websites and are not reproducible"},{"id":"p24s2","text":". Warnings stay in the report and the catalog table. No model is used as a judge."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"This is not a security audit. A skill can contain unsafe instructions or scripts even when its forma"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"t is valid. Read the source, the risk hints, and the license before installing it."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Reproduce the reports"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"CI downloads the pinned upstream validator binary and verifies its published SHA-256. Locally, pass "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"the same binary path:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Add a skill"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"See CONTRIBUTING.md. A submission needs a public source, immutable commit, license evidence, a usefu"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"l DSH trigger in `description`, and a reproduced report. New projects are welcome, but they stay mar"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ked `new`; age and popularity are not invented by the catalog."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"MIT licensed. Catalog entries retain their own licenses. This is a community project, not an officia"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"l DeepSeek component."}],"truncated":false}
